 651:Middlewares/Third_Party/SEGGER/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Reads characters from SEGGER real-time-terminal control block
 652:Middlewares/Third_Party/SEGGER/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    which have been previously stored by the host.
 653:Middlewares/Third_Party/SEGGER/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Do not lock against interrupts and multiple access.
 654:Middlewares/Third_Party/SEGGER/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 655:Middlewares/Third_Party/SEGGER/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
